See _lore/decisions/ADR-019-the-algorithm-lite-provisional-house-style.md.

WHAT CAME FROM WHERE
--------------------

This package is a DERIVED work, not a copy. Be precise about which is which, because
the whole point of the discipline it encodes is that claims about a document are
checkable.

  SKILL.md
    Compressed by us from the v2 prose form (see reference/v2-full.md), applying that
    document's own Self-hosting clause: "This document is subject to its own floor
    test." The Invariants section is carried VERBATIM, per v2's own rule that no edit,
    human or model, may paraphrase it. Everything cut was exposition, never
    specification.

    Measured with `wc -lwc`, both files, same method:
        full   308 lines / 2,898 words / 18,567 bytes
        lite   226 lines / 1,791 words / 11,040 bytes
        40.5% fewer bytes, 38.2% fewer words.

  reference/v2-full.md
    The v2 prose form, copied unmodified.

  The clearance ladder (RED / ORANGE / YELLOW / GREEN)
    From upstream SKILL-mini.md, quoted from verbatim extracts. This concept is NOT
    present in v2 — the mini is not a strict subset of the full, and an escalation from
    lite to full would LOSE it. Recorded because it is the safety property that matters
    most for small models.

